ContextNeed.description:
Per-group tail a step needs at score time: ``n`` rows along ``along`` within groups.

``min_lag`` is the smallest lag the step applies (for recursive-forecast checks);
it defaults to 1 when the step depends on the target.

GuidedQuestion.description:
One plain-language question. Column questions name what the column becomes:

* ``dim``: the column labels a dataset dim (``dim_spec`` describes it); the placeholder
  ``{{<id>}}`` is the dataset dim name;
* ``role`` (``column``): the column is a data variable with that role; the placeholder is
  the dataset variable name;
* ``role`` + ``wide_dim`` (``columns``): the columns become *one* variable ``as_var``
  along ``wide_dim`` (one label per column, e.g. spend per channel);
* ``role`` without ``wide_dim`` (``columns``): each column is its own variable.

RunCreate.description:
Submit a run. Send an ``Idempotency-Key`` header: a retry with the same key and body
returns the original run (200); the same key with a different body is 409
``IDEMPOTENCY_CONFLICT``. Keys are scoped to the project and kept for 24 h.

* ``fit`` / ``validate`` (sandboxed dry-run): ``spec_id`` + ``revision``;
* ``score``: ``model_version_id`` + ``request``;
* ``evaluate`` / ``derive`` / ``render``: ``model_version_id`` (+ ``params``).
